        <head>VENO'S LIGHTNING COUGH CURE Is Guaranteed to Cure COUGH OR COLD IN ONE NIGHT.</head>
        <p>VENO'S LIGHTNING COUGH CURE Is Guaranteed to Cure COUGH OR COLD IN ONE NIGHT.</p>
        <p>The romance of the iTse of Venn's Lightning Cough Cure is most remarkable. In seven years this famous remedy has won its way into nearly every home in G,est Britain and the Colonies. Upwards of two million bottles are sold annually. Doctors prescribe it because it is absolutely the safest, pureq, and most efficient remedy procurable for :</p>
        <p>INFLUENZA NASAL CATARRH</p>
        <p>ASTTINTA WEAK LUNGS</p>
