        <head>FOUR YEARS OF AGONY. -- Biliousness, Spots across sight, Neuralgia. Headache, and Shoulder and Chest Pains.</head>
        <p>FOUR YEARS OF AGONY. -- Biliousness, Spots across sight, Neuralgia. Headache, and Shoulder and Chest Pains.</p>
        <p>Permanent Cure by Chas. Forde's Bile Beans,</p>
        <p>Miss Flora Blaker, of Bert Cottage, Graffham, near Petwortb, Sussex, tells a vivid and touching story of four years of agony from biliousness and its come. quences, and how Chas. Forde's Bile Beans restored her to perfect health. "Four years ago," says Mrs. Blaker,•" I began to stiffer agonies from biliousness and indigestion. I was constantly suffering from severe headaches, and ' had such had turns of giddiness that I often staggered in the street, and it was not safe for me to go out alone. The attacks were always accompanied by severe pains in the chest and shoulders. Spots would dance before my eyes, and often severe neuralgia would follow the attacks making my life a perfect misery. My appetite faded, I could not sleep, and I became a perfect wreck, quite unfit for my work as a housemaid.</p>
        <p>"I tried all sorts of remedies without avail, and I got so low-spirited and melancholy that I gave up all hope of ever getting well again. Rea(ling an Recount of a cure by Chas Forde's Bile Beans I decided to have just one more try to get my health back again. To my great delight, Chas. Forde's Bile Beans brought me great relief. I began to sleep, my appetite returned, and the pains in my chest and shoulders disappeared. The improvement continued, until all my troubles had vanished, and I became my old self again. In Chas. Forde's Bile Beans I found just the remedy I required, and I would not be without them for a fortune. lam quite satisfied that Chas. Forde's Bile Beans have permanently cured my indigestion and biliousness."</p>
        <p>TVr;ting----t-o---d:ay, two years after her cure, Mrs. Blaker says :—" The marvellous cure Chas. Fordc's Bile Beans brought me has been permanent, for I am still in splendid health.' Beware of cheap imitation bile beans. These are worthless and often very harmful. The genuine, original, world-famed fathily medicine has " Cumaxs FORDE'S " clearly printed on tbe label, and is sold by Chemists and Drug Stores, Is. IF, and 2s. Oct. You must see " CHARLES FORM'S " on the box.</p>
