iental, and styles, upholstered in " Tapestry Carpets, from 3 morocco, roan, leather, I yds. to 5 yds. square. saddle bags, velvet, silk, Wool Rugs, Hearth Rugs, tapestry and hair seating. Axminster and Oriental Cabinets in na ahogan y, Rugs, Door Mats, de. A. Chippendale, and walnut. 8-day ;and 14-day Regulator Pier Glasses and Chimney Clocks. Alarum, Marble Glasses. and Fancy Clocks. Brass Bedsteads, French and Pairs of Blankets,Quilte, Lace Parisian. Certain,. de. Iron and Brass Bedsteads, Occasional Tables, Flower Wood Bedsteads in Sheraton Stands. Ac. and Chippendale styles, Vases and Ornaments,Triniost also oak, walnut, and Sets, Toiler. Were, de. mahogany. China Tea Sets, Crown Derby Wire Mattresses and lisle Royal Worcester,fdinton, Mattresses. Venetian, and Bohemian Wool Mattresses and Feather Ware. Beds. A large quantity of Table Wool Flock Bede, Bolsters, Linen, Bed Clothing, Pillows, Ac, de. Eiderdown Quilts, de. de. In order to meet the requirements of buyers of large or small lots, the goods when convedent will be offered singly, leaving the purchasers the option of tiking any number they may require; and any articles may be put up for sale on any day at any time they are asked for by intending purchasers, The Goods were purchased for the Deceased's usual trade awr will be guaranteed perfect in every way unless otherwise described at time of sale. SALE BY AUCTION TO COMMENCE ON EACH OF THE ABOV2 DAYS AT 2 P.M. AND 7 PAL SALE BY PRIVATE TREATY EVERY D Y FROM 9 A.M. THE SALEROOMS ARE OPIMI EVERY DAY, and the public are invitee to call and Inspect the Stocks. FOR FURTHER PARTICI/LARS APPLY AT: THE SALEROOMS, RYLAN DS STREET, WARRINGTON.</p>
